    "The app will close this workspace and use the target's separate sign-in. Saved sources and recovery records are preserved in their original scope. No data is copied to the target.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app will close this workspace and use the target's separate sign-in. Saved sources and recovery records are preserved in their original scope. No data is copied to the target."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用将关闭当前工作区，使用目标环境独立的登录状态。已保存的来源和恢复记录保留在原环境，不会复制到目标环境。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app will remove this device session and attempt server revocation. Your account and captured sources will not be deleted.": {
