    "Display-link cadence measures main-run-loop callbacks, not rendered FPS or GPU work. Recording adds overhead. Compare on the same physical device, power mode, appearance and cache state.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Display-link cadence measures main-run-loop callbacks, not rendered FPS or GPU work. Recording adds overhead. Compare on the same physical device, power mode, appearance and cache state."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示回调节奏反映主线程回调，不代表实际渲染帧率或 GPU 耗时。记录本身也有开销；比较时请保持真机、电源模式、外观与缓存状态一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Display-link callbacks: %.1f Hz": {
