          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Response download": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下载响应"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MetricKit history": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MetricKit 历史报告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MetricKit provides historical summaries from iOS. They are separate from your task recordings and are not live performance readings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MetricKit 提供 iOS 的历史摘要，与任务诊断记录独立，不是实时性能读数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MetricKit delivery requires a physical device. This Simulator can preview the report layout.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MetricKit 报告需要真机接收。当前模拟器可以预览报告样式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Receiving during this app session, until:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在当前 App 进程中接收，最晚到："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pause receiving reports": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂停接收报告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Receive reports for up to 24 hours": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接收报告，最长 24 小时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MetricKit reception requires an internal device-tools build.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接收 MetricKit 报告需要启用设备工具的内部构建。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Receiving stops when you pause, close the app process or reach 24 hours. Reopening the app does not resume it. Background delivery depends on iOS.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂停、结束 App 进程或达到 24 小时后停止接收。重新打开 App 不会自动恢复；后台交付由 iOS 决定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Retry MetricKit storage": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重试保存 MetricKit 摘要"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No MetricKit summaries received": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未收到 MetricKit 摘要"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No report does not mean zero crashes or good performance. iOS decides when data is available; refreshing cannot force a report.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有报告不代表零崩溃或性能良好。数据何时可用由 iOS 决定，刷新无法强制生成报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Historical app metrics": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 历史性能指标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System diagnostic counts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统诊断条目数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refresh saved summaries": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刷新已保存的摘要"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear local MetricKit summaries": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清除本机 MetricKit 摘要"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Historical summaries": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "历史摘要"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Up to 20 summaries covering the last 7 days, stored privately on this device. No raw system payloads, call stacks, exception messages, names or source content are retained. Clearing pauses reception and removes only these local copies.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最多保留覆盖近 7 天的 20 份摘要，仅存储在本机私有空间。不保留原始系统报告、调用栈、异常消息、姓名或来源内容。清除时暂停接收，仅移除这些本地副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Preview a synthetic report": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "预览合成示例报告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Metrics usually describe a past 24-hour window and may arrive separately by source. Diagnostics can arrive sooner when available. Reports may span app versions and cannot identify a specific model or backend.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "性能指标通常覆盖过去 24 小时，不同来源可能分别交付；可用的诊断报告可能更早到达。报告可能跨越 App 版本，不能归因于某个模型或后端。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a crash stack, hang investigation or precise CPU analysis, use Xcode Organizer and Instruments. Xcode-injected MetricKit payloads must not be treated as field performance evidence.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分析崩溃栈、卡顿或精确 CPU 耗时，请使用 Xcode Organizer 和 Instruments。Xcode 注入的测试报告不能当作实际使用性能证据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read the report correctly": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "如何理解报告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pause reception and clear local summaries?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂停接收并清除本地摘要？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System-held reports and separately exported files are not deleted. Receiving is paused, and reopening the app will not resume it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不会删除系统持有的报告和单独导出的文件。接收将暂停，重新打开 App 不会自动恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Synthetic example · not a device measurement": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合成示例 · 非设备测量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Received through MetricKit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过 MetricKit 接收"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reported time window": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "报告覆盖时段"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Received on this device": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机接收时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Latest reported app version": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "报告中的最新 App 版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This window includes multiple app versions. Do not attribute it to one build.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此时段包含多个 App 版本，不能归因于单个构建。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review MetricKit export": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检查 MetricKit 导出内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cumulative CPU and GPU time are totals, not utilization percentages. Missing values are unavailable, not zero. Diagnostic counts are entries in this payload, not crash-free rates.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CPU 和 GPU 时间是累计值，不是使用率。缺失值表示不可用，不代表零。诊断计数是本份报告中的条目数，不是无崩溃率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reported values": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "报告提供的数值"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%.3f–%.3f seconds": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%.3f–%.3f 秒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No histogram buckets reported": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未提供分布区间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the first 64 histogram buckets are retained.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅保留前 64 个分布区间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time to first draw distribution": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次绘制耗时分布"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hang duration distribution": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "卡顿持续时间分布"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time to first draw is a system launch measure. It does not establish that workspace data loaded or the app became usable.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
