    "Window ends": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "覆盖时段结束"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Observations: %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "观测次数：%lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign out of this account": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出这个账号"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No account content is open": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前未打开任何账号内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Saved drafts, captured sources and pending operation IDs remain protected in their original account. Sign in to that account to recover them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已保存的草稿、捕获来源和待处理操作 ID 会继续受保护地保留在原账号内。登录原账号后才能恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verifying sign-out…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在核对退出结果…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No recorded sign-out for this environment": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此环境暂无退出记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local credential": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本机凭据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Server session": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务端会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign-out operation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出操作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Retry this sign-out": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重试这次退出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign-out checked": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出结果已核对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign-out needs attention": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出仍需处理"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A protected copy of this old credential is retained only to retry revocation, until its reported expiry. It cannot reopen account content. Retry preserves any newer sign-in.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此旧凭据的受保护副本仅用于重试撤销，并保留至其声明的到期时间。它不能重新打开账号内容；重试会保留后续的新登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The saved expiry has passed. This is not a new server verification.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已超过保存的到期时间。这不代表刚刚完成了服务端核验。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refresh sign-out records": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "刷新退出记录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign-out does not delete an account, change system permissions or sign out of your Apple ID. Recovery credentials are never included in diagnostic exports.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出不会删除账号、改变系统权限或退出 Apple ID。恢复凭据不会进入诊断导出文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign-in & recovery": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录与恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign out of this account?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出这个账号？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close this account, remove its local credential and attempt server revocation. Captures, drafts and recovery records are preserved. The result remains available from the sign-in screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭此账号，移除本机凭据并尝试在服务端撤销会话。保留捕获内容、草稿和恢复记录；结果可在登录页查看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removal not yet verified": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未核验移除结果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removal verified": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已核验移除"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Removal needs retry": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移除需要重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Revocation not yet verified": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未核验撤销结果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Server confirmed revocation": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务端已确认撤销"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Server rejected this old session": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务端已拒绝此旧会话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Revocation could not be verified": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未能核验撤销结果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reported expiry has passed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已超过声明的到期时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review sign-out": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看退出结果"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This session was signed out. Protected removal or remote revocation can be reviewed in Lab.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此会话已退出。可在 Lab 查看受保护凭据移除或远端撤销的结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Signed out on this device. The server revoked or rejected this session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已在本机退出。服务端已撤销或拒绝此会话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Signed out on this device. The saved session has reached its reported expiry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已在本机退出。保存的会话已达到声明的到期时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Signed out on this device. The remote session could not be revoked. Review and retry the retained revocation-only recovery in Lab.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已在本机退出。未能撤销远端会话；可在 Lab 查看并重试保留的撤销操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Signed out. The server revoked or expired this session, but its protected local record could not be removed. Restoration is blocked; retry removal in Lab.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "账号已关闭。会话已撤销或到期，但本机受保护记录未能移除。已阻止恢复；请在 Lab 重试移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign out is incomplete. This account is closed on this device; protected local removal and remote revocation need retry in Lab.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出尚未完成。此账号已在本机关闭；受保护凭据移除和远端撤销需要在 Lab 重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The account view is closed. Sign-out recovery could not be fully saved; review the retained operation in Lab before leaving this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "账号视图已关闭，但退出恢复结果未能完整保存。离开此设备前，请在 Lab 查看保留的操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign out could not start safely. Finish active work or retry protected storage before leaving this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未能安全开始退出。离开此设备前，请先完成进行中的操作或重试受保护存储。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The earlier sign-out was reviewed. Your current sign-in was preserved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已核对先前的退出操作，当前登录已保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign-out recovery records could not be read. Existing protected records were preserved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未能读取退出恢复记录。现有受保护记录已保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Earlier sign-out operations need attention before another protected receipt can be saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先处理先前的退出操作，再保存新的受保护回执。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Protected local session removal could not be verified.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未能核验本机受保护会话的移除结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear rebuildable network cache": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清理可重建的网络缓存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restore display defaults": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复显示默认值"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear local diagnostic history": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清理本机诊断历史"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restart saved onboarding progress": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新开始已保存的引导"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Refresh the canonical workspace": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新读取工作区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign out of the selected account": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退出选定账号"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clears this app's shared URL cache. Authenticated API requests use an uncached session. Original captures and drafts stay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "清理此 App 的共享 URL 缓存。认证 API 请求使用无缓存会话。保留原始捕获内容与草稿。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Restores theme, language, text size and density defaults, and ends the display trial. Saved Lab presets and system accessibility settings stay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "恢复主题、语言、字号与密度的默认值，并结束显示试用。保留已保存的 Lab 预设与系统辅助功能设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops recording and clears local diagnostic reports and MetricKit summaries. Previously exported copies and reset receipts stay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止诊断采集并清理本机诊断报告及 MetricKit 摘要。保留之前导出的副本与重置回执。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Returns the saved local introduction to Welcome. Its account, sources, recordings, drafts and decisions stay. System permission prompts do not reset.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将已保存的本机引导返回欢迎页。保留其中的账号、来源、录音、草稿与确认记录，不重置系统权限弹窗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads current server state again. It does not delete contacts, sources or pending operation recovery.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新读取服务端当前状态，不删除联系人、来源或待处理操作的恢复记录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Closes only the selected session. Local removal and server revocation are checked separately; drafts remain protected in the original account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅关闭选定会话，分别核对本机移除与服务端撤销。草稿继续受保护地保留在原账号中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset records could not be read. Existing records were preserved; no cleanup will run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未能读取重置记录。已保留现有记录，不会执行清理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Review the unfinished reset before starting another.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始新的重置前，请先查看尚未完成的重置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The account or environment changed. Review a new reset plan.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "账号或环境已改变，请重新审阅重置计划。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset intent could not be saved. No cleanup was started.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未能保存重置意图，尚未开始清理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Return to the reset's original account and environment before resuming this step.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请返回这次重置所属的原账号与环境，再继续此步骤。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset is incomplete. Review the step result before retrying.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重置尚未完成。请查看各步骤结果后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A reset step may have finished, but its receipt could not be saved. Refresh records and resume the same reset.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "某个重置步骤可能已完成，但回执未能保存。请刷新记录并继续同一次重置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset paused. Finish active work or restore the required connection and storage, then resume the same reset.": {
