    "Review progress stays on this device for up to 30 days. Deleting removes the governed preprocessing upload first, then this device's local copy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "审阅进度在本机最多保留 30 天。删除时会先移除受管的预处理上传，再移除本机副本。"
          }
        }
