    "The app returns to your original account first, revokes the test entry, then asks the server to delete all scoped test data and media.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 会先返回原账号，撤销测试入口，再请求服务端删除此范围内的全部测试数据和媒体。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server creates a separate synthetic account. It receives no people, captures, conversations, drafts or pending actions from your current account.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务端会创建独立的合成账号，不会接收当前账号中的人物、采集内容、对话、草稿或待处理操作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server will close new writes, remove scoped data and media, and report the cleanup result here.": {
      "localizations": {
