      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅 Talent Signal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The preview changes in this session. No Calendar permission is requested and nothing is written externally.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "修改只保留在本次预览中，不会请求日历权限，也不会写入外部系统。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talent Signal first records this reviewed change, then finds the existing event by its saved identifier and updates that event only. It never creates a replacement.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Talent Signal 会先记录这次已审阅的修改，再通过已保存的标识符查找现有日程，并只更新这一条；不会新建替代日程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The earlier add did not complete. Confirming saves these changes, then retries one Calendar add without changing the relationship.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "之前的添加没有完成。确认后会先保存修改，再重试添加一条日历日程，人物关系保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No linked Apple Calendar event exists, so this edit changes the Talent Signal activity only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前没有关联的 Apple 日历日程，因此此次修改只会更新 Talent Signal 日程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
