        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同步新确认的日程"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New events sync outbound after confirmation. Talent Signal never imports or browses Apple Calendar; after you review an edit to a linked event, it reads only that saved identifier to update and verify that event.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新日程会在确认后单向同步。Talent Signal 不会导入或浏览 Apple 日历；修改已关联日程时，只会在你审阅后通过已保存的标识符读取、更新并验证那一条日程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turning sync off keeps new events in Talent Signal. A reviewed edit to an already linked event still updates that event only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭同步后，新日程只保留在 Talent Signal；已关联日程经你审阅确认的修改，仍只会更新对应的那一条日程。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
