    },
    "The original is sent to the private preprocessing service and archived for review. Nothing is attached to a person without the next governed step.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原图会发送到私有预处理服务并归档以供核对。完成下一步受控操作前，不会关联到任何人物。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The protected local copy stays for up to 7 days, or until review is complete. The private service also retains the submitted original under the task retention policy so monitor review and deletion remain possible.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "受保护的本地副本最多保留 7 天，或在核对完成后删除。私有服务也会按任务保留策略保存提交的原图，以支持监控核对和删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file could not be saved. Try again.": {
